hange, no test change, no rests_on front matter touched on any page.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:42c44ff0ce6ccf9f9bcd148ab5c59e905317e647","branch":"request/merge-staleness-docs","conditions":"An independent exact-head review of 2808a1289d0cfac9abcdaac7a54b52eceeb9e43a co-signing BOTH artifacts 42c44ff0 at docs and 5392b555 at internal/workroom, reaching the three required conclusions on architecture, security and simplification, and reporting approved or changes-requested. Architecture: state whether the head preserves the contract of the documentation and internal/workroom layers; it is documentation and one comment, so a contract change would be a finding in itself. Security: nothing executable changes, so state that and say whether any corrected sentence could mislead an operator into a less safe act than the old wrong sentence did. Simplification: say whether the new merge.md section earns its length or should be cut. The verdict must also state whether the five specific checks named in the request text hold, in particular whether any fifth wrong passage remains that the audit missed.","head":"2808a1289d0cfac9abcdaac7a54b52eceeb9e43a","to":"a6ac0d547ec6700408e435cb1cc54b9b546c379d2ac28e5528189b5d63592b84"}}